# Scenario name
msgid "What the Dickens"
msgstr "What the Dickens"

# Scenario description
msgid ""
"Patrol around the London area during Christmas. Bah! Humbug! Only one player "
"ship.\n"
"\n"
"Version 2\n"
"\n"
"USN Discord: https://discord.gg/PntGG3a where you can join a game online. "
"There's one nearly every weekend. All experience levels are welcome."
msgstr "Patrol around the London area during Christmas. Bah! Humbug! Only one player ship.\n\nVersion 2\n\nUSN Discord: https://discord.gg/PntGG3a where you can join a game online. There's one nearly every weekend. All experience levels are welcome."

