#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1692
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Protect Belle"
msgstr "Protect Belle"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1757
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid ""
"You did not protect Belle, your dearest love. HMS Scrooge experienced "
"catastrophic environmental systems failure due to crew anguish. All of you "
"suffocated."
msgstr "You did not protect Belle, your dearest love. HMS Scrooge experienced catastrophic environmental systems failure due to crew anguish. All of you suffocated."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1774
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "You protected Belle. Somerset awaits"
msgstr "You protected Belle. Somerset awaits"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1798
#, lua-format
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"Our sensors indicated nebulas forming then disappearing. That is impossible, "
"of course. We started level three diagnostics on our sensors to discover "
"what's wrong. Just before starting the diagnostic, we picked up unusual "
"readings near Bedlam in %s. Perhaps you should investigate"
msgstr "Our sensors indicated nebulas forming then disappearing. That is impossible, of course. We started level three diagnostics on our sensors to discover what's wrong. Just before starting the diagnostic, we picked up unusual readings near Bedlam in %s. Perhaps you should investigate"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1806
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Investigate unusual readings near Bedlam in %s"
msgstr "Investigate unusual readings near Bedlam in %s"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1818
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Bob Cratchit on station Bedlam] Happy Christmas, Scrooge! You are just in "
"time to make our holiday bright. I know it is against your nature, but "
"surely you can decorate our skies with alien enemy ship explosions. In the "
"worst case, we will get a sky decorated with your ship exploding."
msgstr "[Bob Cratchit on station Bedlam] Happy Christmas, Scrooge! You are just in time to make our holiday bright. I know it is against your nature, but surely you can decorate our skies with alien enemy ship explosions. In the worst case, we will get a sky decorated with your ship exploding."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1835
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Destroy marauding enemies"
msgstr "Destroy marauding enemies"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1887
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Bob Cratchit on station Bedlam] I hate to dampen your spirits, but my young "
"maintenance technician, Tim, has become seriously ill. Our medical "
"facilities cannot diagnose, much less treat him. The medical ship Turkey "
"Surprise should be able to help. Could you dock with Bedlam and transport "
"Tim to Turkey Surprise?"
msgstr "[Bob Cratchit on station Bedlam] I hate to dampen your spirits, but my young maintenance technician, Tim, has become seriously ill. Our medical facilities cannot diagnose, much less treat him. The medical ship Turkey Surprise should be able to help. Could you dock with Bedlam and transport Tim to Turkey Surprise?"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1905
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Take Tim from Bedlam to Turkey Surprise"
msgstr "Take Tim from Bedlam to Turkey Surprise"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1916
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid ""
"While you fought off the ships near Bedlam, Tiny Tim, Bob Cratchit's "
"maintenance technician perished along with the others aboard station Bedlam. "
"Your engineering crew were so overcome with grief that they neglected a "
"routie maintenance cycle causing engine failure on HMS Scrooge."
msgstr "While you fought off the ships near Bedlam, Tiny Tim, Bob Cratchit's maintenance technician perished along with the others aboard station Bedlam. Your engineering crew were so overcome with grief that they neglected a routie maintenance cycle causing engine failure on HMS Scrooge."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1934
