"Keep an eye on the City in %s"
msgstr "We are glad you took care of those Ghosts in the machine. They came out of nowhere! We still saw some impossible sensor readings even after our sensor overhaul. We are now conducting a level 5 diagnostic and repair regimen. Keep an eye on the City in %s"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2163
